# Git 换行符统一：防止 Windows 开发的脚本带上 CRLF，在 Linux 服务器上炸出 `$'\r': command not found`
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做任何转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
